# The simplest https front for the JCVC Relay. Add this site to the server's Caddyfile (do not replace the file),
# change the address to yours, point its DNS at the server, then reload Caddy. Caddy gets the certificate itself.
# The Relay already requires a passkey for every phone answer, so no extra login is needed in front of it.
relay.example.com {
	reverse_proxy 127.0.0.1:8087
}
